      "limitations": [
        "N=4096, t=8192; 2 54-bit key-context primes with SEAL TC128 validation; one 54-bit online data prime",
        "Fresh setup delivery is 1761792 padded bytes per sample, separate from online frames; both public-key copies and client secret polynomial are charged",
        "Complete trace/interleave uses 255 public-geometry automorphisms per query; all other response coefficients receive uniform fresh masks",
        "Extracted-LWE PackLWEs uses native sample extraction, constant-term embedding and trace/interleave; FastQuery's full system and SiRNN are not reproduced",
        "Party-local input/output shares use local-dealer random-OT correlations; distributed OT setup, SiRNN and authenticated role transport are absent",
        "Every sample creates fresh HE keys and retires serial one-use conversion state; benchmark oracle alone reconstructs final words",
        "Honest-client one-hot assumption; no malicious-query proof, circuit privacy proof or independent cryptographic review",
        "Frames include HE query/reply plus actual conversion phases; material, setup delivery, boundary estimates and public metadata remain distinct",
        "Caller-owned integer codes; quantizer fitting, fine-tuning and full-checkpoint quality are separate",
        "Tied client output head still retains the complete matrix: embedding relocation releases zero client weight bytes",
        "No decoder placement, independent providers, physical-wire or measured whole-client RSS claim"
      ],
